# Python bytecode. Global, not per-directory — a scripts/__pycache__/ rule
# only covers one level and lets scripts/tests/__pycache__/ straight through.
# That exact narrowness put five .pyc files on hiwave-macos master this week.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# CI-fetched seat metrics feeds (metrics-history working copies)
.cache/
